                              "name": "34 Currency selector · Desktop",
                              "context": "Search and currency open as native modal dialogs over the current page. URL and scroll position stay unchanged on opening. Backdrop opacity 40%; desktop/tablet dialog width 560px and padding 32px; mobile viewport minus 32px and padding 24px. Dialog scrolls internally on short viewports. Escape, outside click, Close/Cancel dismiss; focus returns to opener. Search submission navigates to results; Apply currency refreshes prices on the current page. Motion: open with opacity 0 to 1 and vertical offset 12px to 0 over 240ms, cubic-bezier(0.22,1,0.36,1); backdrop fades in concurrently. Close via Escape, backdrop or Close/Cancel with opacity 1 to 0 and offset 0 to 8px over 180ms ease-in. All content moves together. Reduced motion uses a 100ms fade only for both directions. Keep focus trapped and background scroll held until exit finishes.",
